  "limitations": [
    "Three paired split/training/calibration seeds use overlapping source datasets; descriptive spread is not a confidence interval.",
    "System background CPU snapshots show nonidle observations; latency ratios and hypothetical break-even calls are not deployment speed or payback claims.",
    "Transformation costs include fixed method order and first-consumer import/cache overhead.",
    "RSS is sampled; tree sum may count shared pages repeatedly.",
    "Equal rank and equal full tensor storage coincide for these existing biased float32 two-factor targets.",
    "weighted full input moments are necessarily rank deficient for the selected Linear targets; no universal method superiority."
  ],
